  "description": "DWEA cohort-health overlays. Three panels surface the σ_log verdict: TTFA p95 + chip, TTF-Face p95 + chip, and the cohort-health verdict gauge with the RED_1000 banner. Verdict source is the $verdict template variable, populated from docs/architecture/observability/sigma_log_verdict.json by dashboard-loader.sh. State machine: docs/architecture/observability/sigma-log-verdict-state.md.",
  "editable": true,
  "fiscalYearStartMonth": 0,
  "graphTooltip": 0,
  "id": null,
  "links": [
    {
      "icon": "doc",
      "tags": [],
      "title": "σ_log state machine",
      "tooltip": "State machine + UI affordances spec",
      "type": "link",
      "url": "https://github.com/Dru1d3/dwea/blob/main/docs/architecture/observability/sigma-log-verdict-state.md"
    },
    {
      "icon": "external link",
      "tags": [],
      "title": "DWEA-95 (cohort-floor measurement)",
      "type": "link",
      "url": "/DWEA/issues/DWEA-95"
    }
  ],
  "panels": [
    {
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "σ_log verdict",
      "id": 1,
      "gridPos": { "h": 4, "w": 6, "x": 0, "y": 0 },
      "datasource": null,
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"], "fields": "", "values": false },
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "justifyMode": "center",
        "textMode": "value_and_name",
        "wideLayout": false
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "mappings": [
            {
              "type": "value",
              "options": {
                "GREEN_500": {
                  "color": "green",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "GREEN_500 — cohort-floor 500, measured"
                }
              }
            },
            {
              "type": "value",
              "options": {
                "GREEN_500_FLAG": {
                  "color": "yellow",
                  "index": 1,
                  "text": "GREEN_500_FLAG — cohort-floor 500, σ_log unmeasured (see DWEA-95)"
                }
              }
            },
            {
              "type": "value",
              "options": {
                "RED_1000": {
                  "color": "red",
                  "index": 2,
                  "text": "RED_1000 — cohort-floor doubled to 1,000 — see runbook"
                }
              }
            }
          ],
          "thresholds": { "mode": "absolute", "steps": [{ "color": "green", "value": null }] }
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": { "type": "datasource", "uid": "grafana" },
          "queryType": "snapshot",
          "expr": "$verdict"
        }
      ],
      "description": "Verdict label rendered from the $verdict template variable. Color-coded per state machine. Click the panel to follow the verdict-doc link."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "title": "RED_1000 runbook banner",
      "id": 2,
      "gridPos": { "h": 4, "w": 18, "x": 6, "y": 0 },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "**Active verdict: `$verdict`.** When verdict is `RED_1000`, the cohort-floor doubles to 1,000 sessions and the M1 launch is blocked.\n\n- Runbook: [`sigma-log-red-runbook.md`](https://github.com/Dru1d3/dwea/blob/main/docs/architecture/observability/sigma-log-red-runbook.md)\n- Source decision: [DWEA-95](/DWEA/issues/DWEA-95)\n- State machine: [`sigma-log-verdict-state.md`](https://github.com/Dru1d3/dwea/blob/main/docs/architecture/observability/sigma-log-verdict-state.md)"
      },
      "transparent": true
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "TTFA p95 (s) — budget ≤ 1.5s",
      "id": 3,
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 0, "y": 4 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}" },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "s",
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [{ "color": "green", "value": null }, { "color": "red", "value": 1.5 }]
          }
        }
      },
      "options": {
        "tooltip": { "mode": "multi" },
        "legend": { "displayMode": "list", "placement": "bottom" }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}" },
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.95, sum by (le) (rate(dwea_ttfa_seconds_bucket[5m])))",
          "legendFormat": "TTFA p95"
        }
      ],
      "description": "Time to First Audio p95 against the 1.5s budget from ADR §4.4. Canonical metric: `dwea_ttfa_seconds_bucket` (Prometheus histogram). When verdict is GREEN_500_FLAG the chip panel to the right surfaces the cohort-floor caveat; tooltip → DWEA-95."
    },
